// Repro (updated 2026-08-10): cycle to next with no eligible player at all
// is a no-op (I-13 relaxed), and the stage auto-ends when no players remain
// in the game - the game completes with an empty winner set instead of
// erroring. Note the ordering: the current player (P1) must eliminate the
// others before eliminating themselves, because an out-of-game player's
// instructions are skipped.
player P1, P2
turnorder (P:P1, P:P2)

stage Play for current 1 times {
  set P:P2 out of game
  set P:P1 out of game
  cycle to next
}
